# WoW Smart TSM

1. Run `python tools/doctor.py` and check `diagnostics/repair-queue.json` before new features.
2. Never modify original TradeSkillMaster addon files.
3. Sell first, hold rarely — follow `docs/SMART_HOLD_POLICY.md`.
4. Offline tests ≠ in-game tests.
5. Visual changes after owner acceptance need owner approval.
6. No invented Cursor APIs; repair runner stays disabled by default.
